# Parent tutorials — contract & staleness

## Objective

Parent/tutor guided tours must stay aligned with the **real UI** on desktop and PWA. When a toured screen or control changes, **update the tour and contract tests in the same change**.

## Layers

| Layer | Mechanism | Gate |
|-------|-----------|------|
| **L1** | Vitest inventory + catalog/dict + `listParentTourRuntimeChecks` | Precommit |
| **L2** | Vitest RTL DOM presence (surface fixtures) | Precommit |
| **L3** | Playwright `@parent-tours` on **isolated** stack only | Precommit E2E |

**Mandatory:** every `ParentScreenTourId` and `ParentTutorialId` has a matrix row (`screen:` / `task:`).

**Forbidden:** pointing Playwright at tenant DBs.

## Source of truth

| Contract | Location |
|----------|----------|
| Anchor ids | `PARENT_TOUR_ANCHORS` in `selectors.ts` |
| Runtime matrix | `listParentTourRuntimeChecks()` |
| Spec | `docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-12-parent-portal-guided-tours-design.md` |

## Agent checklist

- [ ] Touched toured UI → tours + L1/L2 updated?
- [ ] New tour → matrix row?
- [ ] Surface-tagged chrome steps still filter correctly?

